{"unit_id":"zhangyongshuai56-hub__dsh-model-picker-brand#card-en","repo":"zhangyongshuai56-hub/dsh-model-picker-brand","commit":"8ee0ebd7cb9019629917f4838bcabbc703d3612a","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-model-picker-brand adds provider marks and model IDs to the DSH Web model picker. It matches brands from overrides, provider IDs or names, then model prefixes. Unknown providers get an initial mark; rendering errors fall back to the model name. No API key or external service is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:169-215","lib/client.js:258-304","package.json:37-48"]}
{"unit_id":"zhangyongshuai56-hub__dsh-model-picker-brand#card-zh","repo":"zhangyongshuai56-hub/dsh-model-picker-brand","commit":"8ee0ebd7cb9019629917f4838bcabbc703d3612a","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-model-picker-brand 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的模型选择器标识插件。它在官方 conversation.input.model.label 插槽注册标签装饰器，在触发按钮、菜单和模型列表中显示提供商标志及模型 ID；匹配时参考用户覆盖、提供商 ID、名称和模型前缀，未知提供商显示首字母标记，渲染异常时回退到模型名称。适合希望辨认模型来源和路由的 DSH 用户。无需额外密钥或外部服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:169-215","lib/client.js:258-304","package.json:37-48"]}
